# AGENT-BRIEF 10: raw run directories are NOT committed; manifests, summary
# tables and figure CSVs ARE. Nothing is ever deleted to tidy up a result --
# a superseded result is marked STALE/VOID in its report and kept.
#
# NOTE: gitignore has no trailing comments -- '#' only starts a comment at the
# start of a line. Keep every comment on its own line.
results/**/run-*/
results/**/events.jsonl
# the full long-format E0 grid (73 MB); regenerate with tools/run_e0.py
results/**/sweep.csv
# Per-worker sweep shards: intermediate scratch, merged into runs.csv / curves.csv
# at the end of a run. Raw output in the sense of AGENT-BRIEF 10, and a moving
# target while a sweep is in flight.
results/**/shard-*.csv
results/**/curve-*.csv
# in-flight writes, promoted by rename when the stage completes
results/**/*.partial.csv
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
